            "title": "p 2",
            "id": 133445,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Racchiudi il testo di questa canzone tra i tag di apertura e chiusura <code>p</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on roses Whiskers on kittens Bright copper kettles Warm \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" woolen mittens \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"120\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h1&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;p&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/p&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
